nfiltered. Had to manually toggle Furniture filter to see only 3 furniture items. Category URL parameter not being applied as automatic filter.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-22\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Cannot maintain seller session to view purchase requests and verify cart request reporting\", \"actual\": \"Unable to access seller purchase request interface due to persistent session loss. Sent purchase request from cart (which cleared cart), but could not verify seller-side visibility of request or confirm that cart request is reported as 'sent' only after request recorded for each item. Cannot complete this test.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-10\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Attempted login with unregistered email (nonexistent@example.com) resulted in error notification 'Invalid credentials. Try: emma@example.com'. Page remained on /login, no authenticated session created.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-11\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Attempted registration with emma@example.com (existing demo account email) produced error notification 'An account with this email already exists'. Page remained on /register, form retained all entered data, no account created or session established.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-12\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Demo accounts accept any password, preventing verification of password validation for registered accounts\", \"actual\": \"Logged in successfully with emma@example.com using password 'wrongpassword' (help text states demo accounts work with any password). Cannot verify password validation behavior for actual registered accounts due to registration/authentication issues.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-13\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Cannot test seller action access control due to session issues and inability to view other users' listings\", \"actual\": \"Observed that 'Mark Sold', 'Delete', and 'Manage Listings' actions appear on seller's own listings (prod-1787754042267 showed these actions). Could not verify that these actions are hidden when viewing another seller's listing due to session loss. Cannot fully test access control for seller management actions.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-14\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Listing created without photo or photo validation\", \"actual\": \"Successfully created listing with title, description, price, category, condition, location, and upcycled status, but without explicitly uploading or confirming photos. No error message or validation feedback for missing photos. Listing was persisted and displayed without photo content. Checklist requires photos to be mandatory.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-15\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Cannot verify price validation - session issues prevent testing\", \"actual\": \"Successfully created listing with valid price ($450). Attempted to test invalid prices (negative, non-numeric) but unable to access create-listing form for testing due to persistent authentication session loss. Cannot confirm if invalid prices are properly rejected.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-23\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Attempted to access create-listing page while not authenticated. Page loaded at URL but displayed empty content (no form elements visible in semantic hints or browser snapshot). This indicates the page may be protected from unauthenticated access. Creating listings, viewing cart, and submitting purchase requests all require successful authentication (demo accounts accepted, unregistered emails rejected).\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-16\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Attempted registration with duplicate email (emma@example.com) produced immediate visible error notification 'An account with this email already exists' in notifications panel. Registration form remained accessible with all entered data preserved, allowing user to correct the email and retry.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-17\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Tested during FT-7 search functionality. Search results and available-item count updated immediately as user typed 'denim' (results: 1 item), without requiring separate search submission. Results restored to 10 items when search field was cleared.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-18\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Tested during FT-6 filtering and sorting. Applied upcycled filter (10 → 5 items), then Furniture category filter (5 → 3 items). Sorted by 'Price: Low to High' - items immediately reordered. Changed all filters - results and count updated immediately without manual refresh. Clearing all filters restored 10 unfiltered items.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-19\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Tested during FT-8 add to cart. Clicked 'Add to Cart' on product detail page - cart count indicator updated from 0 to 1 immediately. Cart page displays correct line item (Vintage Denim Jacket), updated total ($65.00), without manual reload required.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CT-20\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Viewed product detail for 'Handmade Macrame Wall Hanging' (prod-5). All required details consistently displayed: photos (img element), title, description, price ($45), category (Home Decor), condition (New), location (Brooklyn, NY), seller (Emma Green), listing date (Listed 2024-11-21), availability (Add to Cart button present), and upcycled status (badge shown).\"}]}"
